# Offline pin notes — gpw-vv10-ice (stock VV10)

## Result: no pin (CP2K surface gap)

**CP2K 2026.1 rejects stock VV10.** This directory documents the negative
probe so GapCensus does not re-queue `gpw-vv10-ice` as if TYPE VV10 were a
live Quickstep twin of product rVV10.

## Probe (2026-07-26 wave 5; reconfirmed waves 6–10)

Host: Arrhenius tree install `work/cp2k/install` (CP2K 2026.1, libcp2k.so.2026.1;
source revision 85b8a9b49c).  
Input: `water_dimer_vv10.inp` (this directory) — same water-dimer geometry as
`gpw-rvv10-ice`, but `TYPE VV10` / PARAMETERS 5.9 0.0093.

```text
[ABORT] invalid value for enumeration:VV10
  input/input_enumeration_types.F:215
```

Wave-6 / wave-7 / wave-8 / wave-9 / wave-10 re-runs (`cp2k.psmp` with
`LD_LIBRARY_PATH=…/install/lib` and `CP2K_DATA_DIR=…/data`) reproduced the
same abort before any SCF step. Wave-10 also rebased docs onto parent `dev`
@ `75655ede` (assign wave 10 parent) after live re-probe.

Source of truth (`input_cp2k_xc.F` NON_LOCAL TYPE enum, re-read wave 10):

```text
DRSLL | LMKLL | RVV10
```

`input_constants.F`: `vdw_nl_DRSLL=1`, `vdw_nl_LMKLL=2`, `vdw_nl_RVV10=3`
— no `vdw_nl_VV10`.

No `VV10_kernel_table.dat` in `CP2K data/`. Only `rVV10_kernel_table.dat`
(and `vdW_kernel_table.dat` for DRSLL/LMKLL).

## Product path for VV-family nonlocal on GPW

Use **rVV10** (already productized):

- ATV: `GpwDft::rvv10 = true` → `regressions/gpw/gpw-rvv10-ice`
- CP2K twin: `tools/cp2k_oracle/inputs/gpw-rvv10-ice/` (`TYPE RVV10`, b=6.3)

Do not treat rVV10@b=5.9 as stock VV10.

## Unblock

Requires upstream CP2K stock VV10 (or loop policy allowing a non-CP2K
offline oracle for this row). See `.claude/specs/gpw-vv10-ice/spec.md`.
